  "label": "User projected onto the man in the image",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the Black man depicted in the visual material, as the meme's text ('the day i realized i didn't need no bitch to bust a nut') is presented as a personal revelation or statement from him. The man's expressive face and gesturing hands reinforce this projection, making the viewer identify with or imagine themselves as the speaker. The text uses 'I' ('i realized'), which directly deictically anchors the projection onto the speaker (the man in the image).",
